\item OpenAI, \emph{The Campana–Peternell conjecture in dimension six}, 2026-09-25; citation key \texttt{OAI:The-Campana-Peternell-conjecture-in-dimension-six-September-25-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/The-Campana-Peternell-conjecture-in-dimension-six-September-25-2026/main.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/The-Campana-Peternell-conjecture-in-dimension-six-September-25-2026/main.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/The-Campana-Peternell-conjecture-in-dimension-six-September-25-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/The-Campana-Peternell-conjecture-in-dimension-six-September-25-2026/main.pdf}{Latest version}.
